        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t12" value="in advance rather than on demand: no temporal coupling, and the&#10;copy is behind by one broker hop — which is the trade you are making" style="text;html=1;align=center;fontFamily=Caveat;fontSize=18;fontColor=#2F5D3A;" vertex="1" parent="1">
